#### Beastmastery Training
When you learn Beastmastery:
gain proficiency in Wisdom (Animal Handling);
if already proficient, choose one Beastmastery talent for which you meet the prerequisites as a bonus talent;
choose one Beastmastery Package: Rider or Tamer. You may later gain the other Package through Extra Beastmastery Package.
Beastmastery Packages

#### SCOUNDREL TRAINING
When you learn Scoundrel:
gain proficiency in Dexterity (Sleight of Hand);
if already proficient, choose one Mortal Realm Scoundrel talent for which you meet the prerequisites as a bonus talent;
choose one Mortal Realm Trick talent for which you meet the prerequisites as a bonus talent.
